SURVEY — web SSE contract reproduced (source of truth: internal/api/sse/handler.go; web/src/hooks/useRealtimeEvents.ts, web/src/hooks/useSSE.ts, web/src/hooks/useVehicleLive.ts, web/src/lib/sseManager.ts, web/src/api/sseClient.ts)
  Endpoint: GET /api/v1/events  (text/event-stream)
  Named server events -> sealed LiveEvent taxonomy:
    connected            {client_id}                                  -> LiveEvent.Connected
    heartbeat            {time}            (server ticks every 30s)    -> LiveEvent.Heartbeat
    vehicle_update       batch signal/state JSON object               -> LiveEvent.VehicleUpdate
    alert                JSON object                                  -> LiveEvent.Alert
    export_status        JSON object                                  -> LiveEvent.ExportStatus
    achievement_unlocked JSON object                                  -> LiveEvent.AchievementUnlocked
    signal_change        typed envelope {vehicle_id,field,kind,value,ts} -> LiveEvent.Signal(SignalEnvelope)
    (any other named/unnamed frame)                                   -> LiveEvent.Unknown(event,data)
  Client-synthetic 'disconnected' is NOT a LiveEvent; it is modeled as Connection state.
  Signal kind/value coercion mirrors web/src/api/sseClient.ts (long-form ValueKind names + integer
  iota 0=unknown,1=string,2=bool,3/4/7=int,5/6=float,9=time -> compact SignalKind; value -> SignalValue).
  Connection state machine (StateFlow<Connection>): Connecting / Open / Reconnecting / Stale / Closed.
  Staleness: >2 min without event/heartbeat => Stale (ADR-013), state-only (stream NOT dropped).

SCOPE DELIVERED (apps/shared/core/src/commonMain/.../net/sse):
  LiveEvent.kt        Connection enum; sealed LiveEvent (Connected|Heartbeat|VehicleUpdate|Alert|
                      ExportStatus|AchievementUnlocked|Signal|Unknown, each with override val id);
                      SignalKind enum; sealed SignalValue (Number|String|Bool|Time|Null); SignalEnvelope
  SseFrame.kt         SseFrame(event/data/id/retry) + SseFrameParser.feed(chunk) (cross-chunk buffer,
                      comment lines ignored, multi-data joined with \n, \r\n tolerated, single leading
                      space stripped)
  SseDecode.kt        sseJson lenient; decodeEvent(frame)->LiveEvent (never null, degrades to Unknown);
                      decodeEnvelope(JsonObject)->SignalEnvelope?; kind/value tables mirror sseClient.ts
  SseTransport.kt     SseRequest(path,lastEventId) + SseTransport fun-interface open(req):Flow<String>
  SseClient.kt        SseClient + SseConfig + SseClientBuilder DSL + LiveSubscription(events,connection)
                      + factory; subscribe() = channelFlow + watchdog; runConnectionLoop (reconnect/
                      backoff/Last-Event-ID resume); runStalenessWatchdog; backoffDelay (exp + jitter, cap)
  KtorSseTransport.kt production transport streaming text/event-stream (prepareGet/execute/bodyAsChannel),
                      HttpTimeout socket/request = Long.MAX_VALUE; factory KtorSseTransport(baseUrl,token,engine)

